    "detailed_description": "<h1>Draw Mode</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743830/extras/ca6d06991bbdf851080aca1071eeeaf0.poster.avif?t=1755268285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743830/extras/ca6d06991bbdf851080aca1071eeeaf0.mp4?t=1755268285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Find Cats</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743830/extras/dd82c0243910a8d6a09ff220ca07bf43.poster.avif?t=1755268285\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743830/extras/dd82c0243910a8d6a09ff220ca07bf43.webm?t=1755268285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743830/extras/dd82c0243910a8d6a09ff220ca07bf43.mp4?t=1755268285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find over <strong>1,000 mischievous cats</strong> across uniquely hand-drawn maps set in <strong>12 different countries</strong>?<br>Explore peacefully alone or have fun together with a friend in online co-op mode. Once you find all the cats, color the black-and-white maps and create your own colorful world! \ud83d\udc3e\ud83c\udfa8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countries included:</strong><br>\ud83c\udde6\ud83c\uddfa Australia<br>\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Brazil<br>\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde6 Canada<br>\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3 China<br>\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 France<br>\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea Germany<br>\ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5 Japan<br>\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf1 Poland<br>\ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa Russia<br>\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\uddf7 Turkey<br>\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 United Kingdom<br>\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 United States</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Drawing and Coloring</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow guided, number-based coloring step-by-step</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or create your own pastel palette and draw freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft pastel tones and smooth drawing style reduce stress while unleashing your creativity \u270f\ufe0f\ud83c\udf08</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special \u201cMeow FM\u201d Radio Broadcast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special \u201cMeow FM\u201d radio broadcast is filled with lo-fi, chillhop, and calming music, completing the peaceful atmosphere with natural ambient sounds.<br>Plus, surprise radio broadcasts await you! \ud83c\udfa7\ud83c\udfb6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Together in Online Co-op</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to find and color cats together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate your shared achievements because fun is better together! \ud83e\udd1d\ud83d\udc31</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Solo Mode Leaderboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by finding cats in solo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the global leaderboard against other players</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find over <strong>1,000 mischievous cats</strong> across uniquely hand-drawn maps set in <strong>12 different countries</strong>?<br>Explore peacefully alone or have fun together with a friend in online co-op mode. Once you find all the cats, color the black-and-white maps and create your own colorful world! \ud83d\udc3e\ud83c\udfa8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countries included:</strong><br>\ud83c\udde6\ud83c\uddfa Australia<br>\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Brazil<br>\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde6 Canada<br>\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf3 China<br>\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 France<br>\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea Germany<br>\ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5 Japan<br>\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf1 Poland<br>\ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa Russia<br>\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\uddf7 Turkey<br>\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 United Kingdom<br>\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 United States</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Drawing and Coloring</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow guided, number-based coloring step-by-step</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or create your own pastel palette and draw freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft pastel tones and smooth drawing style reduce stress while unleashing your creativity \u270f\ufe0f\ud83c\udf08</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special \u201cMeow FM\u201d Radio Broadcast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special \u201cMeow FM\u201d radio broadcast is filled with lo-fi, chillhop, and calming music, completing the peaceful atmosphere with natural ambient sounds.<br>Plus, surprise radio broadcasts await you! \ud83c\udfa7\ud83c\udfb6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Together in Online Co-op</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to find and color cats together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate your shared achievements because fun is better together! \ud83e\udd1d\ud83d\udc31</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Solo Mode Leaderboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by finding cats in solo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the global leaderboard against other players</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udd8d\ufe0f Grab your pastels and find over 1,000 cats across maps set in more than 10 countries, alone or with a friend. Once you find them all, color and bring the black-and-white maps to life!",
